<title>SPAIN: Dragados signs 4 bln pta refinery contract.</title>
<headline>Dragados signs 4 bln pta refinery contract.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish construction firm Dragados said it had signed a contract worth four billion pesetas ($31.2 million) to modernise and expand a refinery for Costa Rica's Refineria Costarricense de Petroleos SA (Recope).</p>
<p>Dragados plans to complete the project in 20 months and will work together with Intecsa-Uhdel, in which it owns a stake.</p>
<p>--Madrid Newsroom +34 1 585 2167 ($ = 128.0 Spanish Pesetas)</p>
</text>
